      "comment": "LA FAMILIA NZ (9) suffered her first defeat since crossing from NZ when she bombed the start at her latest appearance at Menangle. Enjoys a class drop here and had won her other three starts in Australia by good margins. Expecting her to return to the winners' list in this suitable assignment. SWIFT CODE (1) was a beaten favourite when midfield here last week but did have a much wider barrier. Can do better from the ace draw. ANGELIC COPY NZ (8) draws wide but made it two for two at this venue when she came from the back row for a last-start win by 4.7 metres. Can feature again along with AWICKED WOMAN (2) who draws well and was good in coming from the back line for a last-start win.",
